#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Unlocks the ability to observe [color=#FFD16D]Meteor Shower[/color] and "
"[color=#FFD16D]Starfall[/color] events in Firemaking"
msgstr ""
"Desbloquea la capacidad de observar eventos de [color=#FFD16D]Lluvia de "
"meteoritos[/color] y [color=#FFD16D]Lluvia de estrellas[/color] en Dominio "
"del fuego"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Unlocks the ability to obtain [color=#FFD16D]Fireflies[/color] while burning"
" Logs in Firemaking"
msgstr ""
"Desbloquea la capacidad de obtener [color=#FFD16D]Luciérnagas[/color] al "
"quemar troncos en Dominio del fuego"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Unlocks [color=#FFD16D]Astral Offerings[/color] toggle in Beastcrafting for "
"Beast Weapons and Beast Armour, allowing you to offer your crafted Item in "
"return for a potential gift."
msgstr ""
"Desbloquea la opción [color=#FFD16D]Ofrendas astrales[/color] en Artesanía "
"bestial para armas y armaduras bestiales, que te permite ofrecer el objeto "
"fabricado a cambio de un posible regalo."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Unlocks the [color=#FFD16D]Sacrificial Anvil[/color] in Smithing, allowing "
"you to sacrifice your smithed item in return for extra Skill XP, GP or a "
"rare Collectable"
msgstr ""
"Desbloquea el [color=#FFD16D]Yunque de sacrificio[/color] en Herrería, que "
"te permite sacrificar el objeto forjado a cambio de XP de habilidad "
"adicional, ORO o un coleccionable raro"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Unlocks the [color=#FFD16D]Smelting -> Star Forge[/color] in Smithing, "
"allowing to you create Alloy Bars such as Ironsteel or Dragonrune"
msgstr ""
"Desbloquea [color=#FFD16D]Fundición -> Forja estelar[/color] en Herrería, "
"que te permite crear lingotes de aleación como ferroacero o runadragón"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Unlocks [color=#FFD16D]Astral Jewellery[/color] in Crafting"
msgstr "Desbloquea la [color=#FFD16D]Joyería astral[/color] en Artesanía"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Unlocks [color=#FFD16D]Night Sprints[/color] in Agility."
msgstr "Desbloquea las [color=#FFD16D]Carreras nocturnas[/color] en Agilidad."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Unlocks the [color=#FFD16D]Catalyst Toolbelt Slot[/color] in Herblore"
msgstr ""
"Desbloquea la [color=#FFD16D]ranura de catalizador del cinturón de "
"herramientas[/color] en Herbología"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Observation"
msgid_plural "Observations"
msgstr[0] "Observación"
msgstr[1] "Observaciones"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You study the stars carefully, but they remain silent."
msgstr "Estudias las estrellas con atención, pero siguen en silencio."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The constellation offers no insight this time."
msgstr "Esta vez la constelación no te revela nada."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Whatever message the stars held has slipped away."
msgstr "Sea cual fuera el mensaje de las estrellas, se ha esfumado."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You sense a faint presence among the stars, but it quickly fades."
msgstr ""
"Percibes una débil presencia entre las estrellas, pero se desvanece "
"enseguida."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The constellation's light flickers without revealing its secrets."
msgstr "La luz de la constelación parpadea sin revelar sus secretos."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You wait patiently for a sign, but none arrives."
msgstr "Esperas pacientemente una señal, pero no llega ninguna."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You almost discern a message before it vanishes from your thoughts."
msgstr ""
"Casi llegas a descifrar un mensaje antes de que se esfume de tu mente."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The constellation politely declines to elaborate."
msgstr "La constelación declina educadamente dar más detalles."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You feel certain the stars judged your attempt. They offer no further "
"comment."
msgstr ""
"Tienes la certeza de que las estrellas han juzgado tu intento. No hacen más "
"comentarios."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Even the stars have off days."
msgstr "Hasta las estrellas tienen días malos."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You continue to observe the stars, confirming that they are indeed stars."
msgstr ""
"Sigues observando las estrellas y confirmas que, en efecto, son estrellas."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Deedree Observation"
msgid_plural "Deedree Observations"
msgstr[0] "Observación de Deedree"
msgstr[1] "Observaciones de Deedree"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars insist that talking to plants helps. They refuse to comment on "
"whether the plants listen."
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas insisten en que hablar con las plantas ayuda. Se niegan a "
"comentar si las plantas escuchan."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation warns that the tallest tree always wins an argument with a"
" blunt axe."
msgstr ""
"La constelación advierte de que el árbol más alto siempre gana la discusión "
"contra un hacha sin filo."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal that weeds are simply crops with exceptional confidence."
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas revelan que las malas hierbas no son más que cultivos con una "
"confianza excepcional."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars suggest that planting today is wiser than promising you'll plant "
"tomorrow."
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas sugieren que plantar hoy es más sensato que prometer que "
"plantarás mañana."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims every mighty Oak Tree was once a seed that ignored "
"terrible advice."
msgstr ""
"La constelación afirma que todo roble poderoso fue una vez una semilla que "
"ignoró consejos terribles."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars quietly remind you that chopping the tree before collecting the "
"fruit is rarely the optimal strategy."
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas te recuerdan en voz baja que talar el árbol antes de recoger "
"la fruta rara vez es la estrategia óptima."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Terra Observation"
msgid_plural "Terra Observations"
msgstr[0] "Observación de Terra"
msgstr[1] "Observaciones de Terra"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars wonder why you're not mining Coal right now."
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas se preguntan por qué no estás extrayendo carbón ahora mismo."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars insist that hitting the rock harder is a valid mining strategy."
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas insisten en que golpear la roca con más fuerza es una "
"estrategia de minería válida."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellations insists you are one Geode away from finding that rare "
"item."
msgstr ""
"La constelación insiste en que estás a una geoda de encontrar ese objeto "
"raro."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars wonder how staring at them all night helps build Strength."
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas se preguntan cómo te ayuda a ganar Fuerza mirarlas toda la "
"noche."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation reminds you that a high Strength level won't save you from"
" the Coal mines."
msgstr ""
"La constelación te recuerda que un nivel alto de Fuerza no te salvará de las"
" minas de carbón."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars stare back at you."
msgstr "Las estrellas te devuelven la mirada."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Ameria Observation"
msgid_plural "Ameria Observations"
msgstr[0] "Observación de Ameria"
msgstr[1] "Observaciones de Ameria"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars whisper that fish are far less cooperative once they realize "
"they're on the menu."
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas susurran que los peces colaboran mucho menos cuando se dan "
"cuenta de que están en el menú."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars suggest drying your firewood before complaining that it won't "
"burn."
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas sugieren secar la leña antes de quejarte de que no arde."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation reminds you that cooking the fish is generally easier "
"after you've caught it."
msgstr ""
"La constelación te recuerda que cocinar el pescado suele ser más fácil "
"después de haberlo pescado."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation insists that a warm campfire has ended more adventures "
"than any monster."
msgstr ""
"La constelación insiste en que una hoguera cálida ha puesto fin a más "
"aventuras que cualquier monstruo."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars guide you to a secluded stream within the Shrapnel River."
msgstr "Las estrellas te guían hasta un arroyo apartado del Río de metralla."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.UnlockText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=green]This observation grants you with access to the Moonlit Stream "
"Fishing spot.[/color]"
msgstr ""
"[color=green]Esta observación te da acceso a la zona de pesca del Arroyo "
"iluminado por la luna.[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Midnight Cove of Ameria"
msgid_plural "Midnight Cove of Ameria"
msgstr[0] "Cala de medianoche de Ameria"
msgstr[1] "Cala de medianoche de Ameria"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars guide you to a hidden spot along the Windy Coastline."
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas te guían hasta un lugar oculto a lo largo de la Costa ventosa."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.UnlockText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=green]This observation grants you with access to the Midnight Cove "
"Fishing spot.[/color]"
msgstr ""
"[color=green]Esta observación te da acceso a la zona de pesca de la Cala de "
"medianoche.[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Ceedyr Observation"
msgid_plural "Ceedyr Observations"
msgstr[0] "Observación de Ceedyr"
msgstr[1] "Observaciones de Ceedyr"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims every perfect hide once belonged to something that "
"strongly preferred keeping it."
msgstr ""
"La constelación afirma que toda piel perfecta perteneció una vez a algo que "
"prefería con todas sus fuerzas conservarla."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation wonders why creatures are so attached to materials you "
"clearly need for crafting."
msgstr ""
"La constelación se pregunta por qué las criaturas tienen tanto apego a "
"materiales que claramente necesitas para fabricar."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars remind you that chasing wildlife is considerably easier without "
"carrying half your workshop."
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas te recuerdan que perseguir animales salvajes es bastante más "
"fácil sin cargar con medio taller."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars insist that \"I'll just hunt one more\" has misled countless "
"adventurers."
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas insisten en que «solo cazo uno más» ha engañado a incontables "
"aventureros."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation reveals that collecting \"just in case\" materials "
"eventually becomes a storage problem."
msgstr ""
"La constelación revela que guardar materiales «por si acaso» acaba "
"convirtiéndose en un problema de espacio."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Moonlit Hills of Ceedyr"
msgid_plural "Moonlit Hills of Ceedyr"
msgstr[0] "Colinas iluminadas por la luna de Ceedyr"
msgstr[1] "Colinas iluminadas por la luna de Ceedyr"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The constellation lights a path towards a hidden opening in the Hills."
msgstr ""
"La constelación ilumina un camino hacia una abertura oculta en las colinas."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.UnlockText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=green]This observation grants you with access to the Moonlit Hills "
"Hunting Location.[/color]"
msgstr ""
"[color=green]Esta observación te da acceso a la zona de caza de las Colinas "
"iluminadas por la luna.[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Crescent Lake of Iridan"
msgid_plural "Crescent Lake of Iridan"
msgstr[0] "Lago de la Media Luna de Iridan"
msgstr[1] "Lago de la Media Luna de Iridan"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation points toward a tranquil lake where the water curves like "
"a crescent moon. A hidden shoreline beckons those willing to seek it."
msgstr ""
"La constelación señala un lago tranquilo cuyas aguas se curvan como una luna"
" creciente. Una orilla oculta llama a quienes estén dispuestos a buscarla."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.UnlockText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=green]This observation grants you with access to the Crescent Lake "
"Combat Area.[/color]"
msgstr ""
"[color=green]Esta observación te da acceso a la zona de combate del Lago de "
"la Media Luna.[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Iridan Observation"
msgid_plural "Iridan Observations"
msgstr[0] "Observación de Iridan"
msgstr[1] "Observaciones de Iridan"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars claim that yelling while attacking increases accuracy."
msgstr "Las estrellas afirman que gritar al atacar aumenta la precisión."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars remind you that every dent in your armour is a valuable lesson. "
"Preferably someone else's lesson."
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas te recuerdan que cada abolladura de tu armadura es una lección"
" valiosa. A ser posible, la lección de otro."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims that missing your target is not a valid strategy."
msgstr ""
"La constelación afirma que fallar el objetivo no es una estrategia válida."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars claim every unique weapon began life as \"good enough for now.\""
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas afirman que toda arma única empezó siendo «suficiente por "
"ahora»."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars insist that hitting harder is a perfectly valid strategy."
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas insisten en que golpear más fuerte es una estrategia "
"perfectamente válida."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Syllia Observation"
msgid_plural "Syllia Observations"
msgstr[0] "Observación de Syllia"
msgstr[1] "Observaciones de Syllia"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims every arrow flies true until the wind develops a "
"personality."
msgstr ""
"La constelación afirma que toda flecha vuela recta hasta que el viento "
"desarrolla personalidad propia."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars suggest aiming before celebrating the shot."
msgstr "Las estrellas sugieren apuntar antes de celebrar el disparo."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation reminds you that trees rarely volunteer to become arrows."
msgstr ""
"La constelación te recuerda que los árboles rara vez se ofrecen voluntarios "
"para convertirse en flechas."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars wonder why arrows are always found in the most inconvenient "
"places."
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas se preguntan por qué las flechas siempre aparecen en los "
"sitios más inoportunos."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims a quiver is merely a very organised collection of "
"future mistakes."
msgstr ""
"La constelación afirma que un carcaj no es más que una colección muy "
"ordenada de errores futuros."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation advises remembering that boomerangs are designed to "
"return."
msgstr ""
"La constelación te aconseja recordar que los bumeranes están diseñados para "
"volver."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Haemir Observation"
msgid_plural "Haemir Observations"
msgstr[0] "Observación de Haemir"
msgstr[1] "Observaciones de Haemir"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Placeholder to replace."
msgstr "Texto provisional por sustituir."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Arachi Observation"
msgid_plural "Arachi Observations"
msgstr[0] "Observación de Arachi"
msgstr[1] "Observaciones de Arachi"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars insist that every spell is perfectly safe until proven otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas insisten en que todo hechizo es perfectamente seguro hasta que"
" se demuestre lo contrario."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation wonders why wizards keep writing things down when they can"
" barely read their own spellbooks."
msgstr ""
"La constelación se pregunta por qué los magos siguen tomando notas si apenas"
" saben leer sus propios libros de hechizos."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The heavens insist that magical explosions are merely enthusiastic "
"successes."
msgstr ""
"Los cielos insisten en que las explosiones mágicas no son más que éxitos "
"entusiastas."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal that every great mage has accidentally cast something they "
"absolutely didn't mean to."
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas revelan que todo gran mago ha lanzado sin querer algo que no "
"tenía ninguna intención de lanzar."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation reminds you that staring at it all night won't solve your "
"Rune supply problems."
msgstr ""
"La constelación te recuerda que mirarla toda la noche no resolverá tus "
"problemas de suministro de runas."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Astral Learning of Arachi"
msgid_plural "Astral Learnings of Arachi"
msgstr[0] "Saber astral de Arachi"
msgstr[1] "Saberes astrales de Arachi"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You somehow learn a new form of Magic by simply looking at the stars and "
"pretending to read them or something lol."
msgstr ""
"De algún modo aprendes una nueva forma de magia con solo mirar las estrellas"
" y fingir que las lees o algo así, jaja."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.UnlockText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=green]This observation grants you with the knowledge to use Astral "
"Spells.[/color]"
msgstr ""
"[color=green]Esta observación te otorga el conocimiento para usar hechizos "
"astrales.[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Astral Learning of Hyden"
msgid_plural "Astral Learnings of Hyden"
msgstr[0] "Saber astral de Hyden"
msgstr[1] "Saberes astrales de Hyden"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation reveals an ancient rite. Its celestial words awaken the "
"power of Astral Prayers."
msgstr ""
"La constelación revela un rito antiguo. Sus palabras celestiales despiertan "
"el poder de las plegarias astrales."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.UnlockText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=green]This observation grants you with the knowledge to use Astral "
"Prayers.[/color]"
msgstr ""
"[color=green]Esta observación te otorga el conocimiento para usar plegarias "
"astrales.[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Hyden Observation"
msgid_plural "Hyden Observations"
msgstr[0] "Observación de Hyden"
msgstr[1] "Observaciones de Hyden"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal that blessed logs burn brighter than ordinary ones. "
"Coincidence, perhaps."
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas revelan que los troncos bendecidos arden con más brillo que "
"los normales. Quizá sea casualidad."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars wonder who first looked at a pile of bones and thought, \"The gods"
" will love this.\""
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas se preguntan quién fue el primero en mirar un montón de huesos"
" y pensar: «A los dioses les va a encantar»."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation insist that divine favour cannot be bought. Offerings, "
"however, are gladly accepted."
msgstr ""
"La constelación insiste en que el favor divino no se puede comprar. Las "
"ofrendas, en cambio, se aceptan con gusto."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims the gods have excellent taste in offerings, though "
"their preferences remain oddly specific."
msgstr ""
"La constelación afirma que los dioses tienen un gusto excelente para las "
"ofrendas, aunque sus preferencias siguen siendo curiosamente concretas."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation observes that the gods rarely explain why they like bones."
" They simply do."
msgstr ""
"La constelación observa que los dioses rara vez explican por qué les gustan "
"los huesos. Simplemente les gustan."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Moonscarred Crater of Vale"
msgid_plural "Moonscarred Crater of Vale"
msgstr[0] "Cráter marcado por la luna de Vale"
msgstr[1] "Cráter marcado por la luna de Vale"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal a crater where moonlight never truly fades. Something "
"ancient still stirs within its scar."
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas revelan un cráter donde la luz de la luna nunca llega a "
"apagarse. Algo antiguo aún se agita en su cicatriz."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.UnlockText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=green]This observation grants you with access to the Moonscarred "
"Crater Slayer Zone.[/color]"
msgstr ""
"[color=green]Esta observación te da acceso a la zona de exterminio del "
"Cráter marcado por la luna.[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Vale Observation"
msgid_plural "Vale Observations"
msgstr[0] "Observación de Vale"
msgstr[1] "Observaciones de Vale"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars wonder where your ingredients go when you fail to cook something."
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas se preguntan adónde van tus ingredientes cuando no consigues "
"cocinar algo."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims a hearty meal can solve many problems. The "
"remaining problems usually require a weapon."
msgstr ""
"La constelación afirma que una buena comida puede resolver muchos problemas."
" Los demás suelen requerir un arma."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation insists that eating during a battle is a skill worthy of "
"admiration."
msgstr ""
"La constelación insiste en que comer en plena batalla es una habilidad digna"
" de admiración."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal that a full stomach is often the first step toward "
"surviving the next encounter."
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas revelan que un estómago lleno suele ser el primer paso para "
"sobrevivir al siguiente encuentro."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims every meal tastes better after narrowly avoiding "
"defeat."
msgstr ""
"La constelación afirma que cualquier comida sabe mejor después de librarte "
"por poco de la derrota."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Ko Observation"
msgid_plural "Ko Observations"
msgstr[0] "Observación de Ko"
msgstr[1] "Observaciones de Ko"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The constellation claims locked doors are merely suggestions."
msgstr ""
"La constelación afirma que las puertas cerradas son meras sugerencias."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal that every graceful landing is built upon countless less "
"graceful ones."
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas revelan que todo aterrizaje elegante se apoya en incontables "
"aterrizajes mucho menos elegantes."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars wonder why NPCs cannot pickpocket you as well."
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas se preguntan por qué los PNJ no pueden robarte a ti también."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation hints at accepting bribes for more Stealth in return."
msgstr "La constelación insinúa que aceptes sobornos a cambio de más Sigilo."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation wonders why a very specific item seems to constantly "
"appear on random routes."
msgstr ""
"La constelación se pregunta por qué un objeto muy concreto parece aparecer "
"constantemente en rutas al azar."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation reminds you that it cannot assist with your Lockpick "
"problem."
msgstr ""
"La constelación te recuerda que no puede ayudarte con tu problema de "
"ganzúas."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Tellus Observation"
msgid_plural "Tellus Observations"
msgstr[0] "Observación de Tellus"
msgstr[1] "Observaciones de Tellus"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars insist that the best defence is letting the monster become someone"
" else's assignment."
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas insisten en que la mejor defensa es dejar que el monstruo se "
"convierta en la tarea de otro."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims every Slayer task looks reasonable until you "
"actually arrive."
msgstr ""
"La constelación afirma que toda tarea de exterminio parece razonable hasta "
"que llegas."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal that shields are much easier to repair than confidence."
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas revelan que los escudos son mucho más fáciles de reparar que "
"la confianza."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars wonder if Slayer Masters secretly compete to invent increasingly "
"inconvenient tasks."
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas se preguntan si los maestros de exterminio compiten en secreto"
" por inventar tareas cada vez más incómodas."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation insists that \"just one more monster\" has delayed many "
"journeys home."
msgstr ""
"La constelación insiste en que «solo un monstruo más» ha retrasado muchos "
"viajes de vuelta a casa."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal that every experienced slayer has confidently attacked the "
"wrong monster at least once."
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas revelan que todo exterminador experimentado ha atacado con "
"total seguridad al monstruo equivocado al menos una vez."

