#: Tutorials/beastcrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Craft Specialised Equipment"
msgstr "Fabrica equipo especializado"

#: Tutorials/beastcrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Use materials obtained from Hunting and Combat to create various types of "
"specialised equipment."
msgstr ""
"Usa materiales obtenidos en Caza y Combate para crear distintos tipos de "
"equipo especializado."

#: Tutorials/beastcrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Slayer Equipment"
msgstr "Equipo de exterminio"

#: Tutorials/beastcrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Craft powerful Slayer weapons and armour to improve your effectiveness "
"during Slayer training for all Melee, Ranged and Magic"
msgstr ""
"Fabrica potentes armas y armaduras de exterminio para mejorar tu eficacia al"
" entrenar Exterminio con cuerpo a cuerpo, a distancia y magia"

#: Tutorials/beastcrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Consumables & Accessories"
msgstr "Consumibles y accesorios"

#: Tutorials/beastcrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Create Consumables and Accessories that provide useful bonuses to various "
"skills."
msgstr ""
"Crea consumibles y accesorios que dan bonificaciones útiles a varias "
"habilidades."

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Difficulty: "
msgstr "Dificultad: "

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "to"
msgstr "a"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "General Info"
msgstr "Información general"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Fight Enemies"
msgstr "Lucha contra enemigos"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Battle enemies to gain [color=#FFD16D]Combat Skill XP[/color] and collect "
"valuable rewards as loot. [color=#FFD16D]Combat Skill XP[/color] is granted "
"based on the [color=#FFD16D]weapon damage[/color] you deal."
msgstr ""
"Combate contra enemigos para ganar [color=#FFD16D]XP de habilidades de "
"combate[/color] y conseguir valiosas recompensas como botín. La "
"[color=#FFD16D]XP de habilidades de combate[/color] se otorga según el "
"[color=#FFD16D]daño de arma[/color] que inflijas."

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Choose a Combat Area"
msgstr "Elige una zona de combate"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Select from [color=#FFD16D]Combat Areas, Slayer Zones[/color] or "
"[color=#FFD16D]Dungeons[/color] to find different enemies to battle."
msgstr ""
"Elige entre [color=#FFD16D]zonas de combate, zonas de exterminio[/color] o "
"[color=#FFD16D]mazmorras[/color] para encontrar distintos enemigos contra "
"los que luchar."

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Automatic Healing via Auto Eat"
msgstr "Curación automática con la autoalimentación"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"[color=#FFD16D]Equip [u]Food[/u][/color] to automatically restore Health when it falls below a set threshold, helping you survive longer battles.\n"
"\n"
"More information is contained by hovering over the [color=#FFD16D]Auto Eat icon on your Health Bar[/color]."
msgstr ""
"[color=#FFD16D]Equipa [u]comida[/u][/color] para recuperar salud automáticamente cuando baje de un umbral fijado y así aguantar combates más largos.\n"
"\n"
"Para más información, pasa el cursor sobre el [color=#FFD16D]icono de autoalimentación de tu barra de salud[/color]."

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Combat Styles"
msgstr "Estilos de combate"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"There are three Combat Styles: [color=#FFD16D]Melee, Ranged[/color] and [color=#FFD16D]Magic[/color]. Your equipped [color=#FFD16D]weapon[/color] determines which style you use.\n"
"\n"
"[color=#FFD16D]Melee[/color] beats [color=#FFD16D]Ranged[/color]\n"
"[color=#FFD16D]Ranged[/color] beats [color=#FFD16D]Magic[/color]\n"
"[color=#FFD16D]Magic[/color] beats [color=#FFD16D]Melee[/color]\n"
"\n"
"Beating a Combat Style [color=green]increases your Max Hit by 10%[/color], while losing [color=orange_red]decreases it by 10%[/color]. This is only applied to you, and never the Enemy."
msgstr ""
"Hay tres estilos de combate: [color=#FFD16D]cuerpo a cuerpo, a distancia[/color] y [color=#FFD16D]magia[/color]. El [color=#FFD16D]arma[/color] que lleves equipada determina el estilo que usas.\n"
"\n"
"[color=#FFD16D]Cuerpo a cuerpo[/color] vence a [color=#FFD16D]a distancia[/color]\n"
"[color=#FFD16D]A distancia[/color] vence a [color=#FFD16D]magia[/color]\n"
"[color=#FFD16D]Magia[/color] vence a [color=#FFD16D]cuerpo a cuerpo[/color]\n"
"\n"
"Vencer a un estilo de combate [color=green]aumenta tu golpe máx. un 10 %[/color], mientras que perder [color=orange_red]lo reduce un 10 %[/color]. Esto solo se te aplica a ti, nunca al enemigo."

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Ranged required Ammunition"
msgstr "A distancia requiere munición"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Using the [color=#FFD16D]Ranged Combat Style[/color] requires a [color=#FFD16D]Ranged Weapon[/color] plus its [color=#FFD16D]ammunition[/color]. For example, using a [u]Bow[/u] requires [u]Arrows[/u] as ammunition primarily obtained from Fletching.\n"
"\n"
"Some [color=#FFD16D]Ranged Weapons[/color] like [u]Javelins[/u] can be their own [color=#FFD16D]ammunition[/color]."
msgstr ""
"Usar el [color=#FFD16D]estilo de combate a distancia[/color] requiere un [color=#FFD16D]arma a distancia[/color] y su [color=#FFD16D]munición[/color]. Por ejemplo, un [u]arco[/u] requiere [u]flechas[/u] como munición, que se obtienen sobre todo en Arquería.\n"
"\n"
"Algunas [color=#FFD16D]armas a distancia[/color], como las [u]jabalinas[/u], pueden ser su propia [color=#FFD16D]munición[/color]."

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Magic requires Runes"
msgstr "La magia requiere runas"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"The [color=#FFD16D]Magic Combat Style[/color] requires a "
"[color=#FFD16D]Magic Weapon[/color] in combination with the the use of "
"[color=aqua]Magic Spells[/color]. These cost [u]Runes[/u] primarily obtained"
" from Runecrafting."
msgstr ""
"El [color=#FFD16D]estilo de combate de magia[/color] requiere un "
"[color=#FFD16D]arma mágica[/color] junto con el uso de "
"[color=aqua]hechizos[/color]. Estos cuestan [u]runas[/u], que se obtienen "
"sobre todo en Creación de runas."

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Stances"
msgstr "Posturas"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Combat Stances"
msgstr "Posturas de combate"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Each weapon has different [color=#FFD16D]Stances[/color] to choose from. "
"Your selected [color=#FFD16D]Stance[/color] determines which Combat Skills "
"gain XP."
msgstr ""
"Cada arma tiene distintas [color=#FFD16D]posturas[/color] para elegir. La "
"[color=#FFD16D]postura[/color] que elijas determina qué habilidades de "
"combate ganan XP."

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Weapon choice matters"
msgstr "La elección del arma importa"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"The [color=#FFD16D]weapon[/color] you use determines the "
"[color=#FFD16D]Stances[/color] available to choose from. Not all "
"[color=#FFD16D]weapons[/color] have access to all "
"[color=#FFD16D]Stances[/color]."
msgstr ""
"El [color=#FFD16D]arma[/color] que uses determina las "
"[color=#FFD16D]posturas[/color] disponibles. No todas las "
"[color=#FFD16D]armas[/color] tienen acceso a todas las "
"[color=#FFD16D]posturas[/color]."

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
#: Entities/Combat/offensive_stats_container.tscn
msgid "Chance to Hit"
msgstr "Probabilidad de impactar"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Take a look at the [color=#FFD16D]Equipment Stats[/color] tab to see how "
"this is calculated in relation to your [color=#FFD16D]Stance[/color]."
msgstr ""
"Echa un vistazo a la pestaña [color=#FFD16D]Estadísticas de equipo[/color] "
"para ver cómo se calcula en relación con tu [color=#FFD16D]postura[/color]."

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn Entities/Combat/view_player_stats_panel.tscn
msgid "Equipment Stats"
msgstr "Estadísticas de equipo"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Accuracy & Evasion"
msgstr "Precisión y evasión"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Your [color=#FFD16D]chance to hit[/color] depends on your [color=#FFD16D]Stance's Accuracy[/color] compared to the [color=#FFD16D]Enemy's Evasion[/color] against that same [color=#FFD16D]Stance[/color].\n"
"\n"
"When fighting an Enemy, aim to have a higher [color=#FFD16D]Accuracy Rating[/color] than their [color=#FFD16D]Evasion Rating[/color]."
msgstr ""
"Tu [color=#FFD16D]probabilidad de acertar[/color] depende de la [color=#FFD16D]precisión de tu postura[/color] frente a la [color=#FFD16D]evasión del enemigo[/color] contra esa misma [color=#FFD16D]postura[/color].\n"
"\n"
"Al luchar contra un enemigo, intenta tener un [color=#FFD16D]índice de precisión[/color] mayor que su [color=#FFD16D]índice de evasión[/color]."

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Power & Protection"
msgstr "Poder y protección"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Damage from attacks is reduced by a percentage depending on [color=#FFD16D]Power[/color] and [color=#FFD16D]Protection[/color].\n"
"\n"
"Your [color=#FFD16D]Power[/color] compared to the [color=#FFD16D]Enemy's Protection[/color] determines how much of your damage is reduced. Higher [color=#FFD16D]Power[/color] helps overcome enemy [color=#FFD16D]Protection[/color].\n"
"\n"
"[color=#FFD16D]Power[/color] is primarily obtained from [color=#FFD16D]weapons[/color].\n"
"[color=#FFD16D]Protection[/color] is primarily obtained from other gear.\n"
"\n"
"You can reduce an Enemy's damage dealt to you by increasing your [color=#FFD16D]Protection[/color]."
msgstr ""
"El daño de los ataques se reduce en un porcentaje que depende del [color=#FFD16D]poder[/color] y la [color=#FFD16D]protección[/color].\n"
"\n"
"Tu [color=#FFD16D]poder[/color] frente a la [color=#FFD16D]protección del enemigo[/color] determina cuánto se reduce tu daño. Un [color=#FFD16D]poder[/color] mayor ayuda a superar la [color=#FFD16D]protección[/color] enemiga.\n"
"\n"
"El [color=#FFD16D]poder[/color] se obtiene sobre todo de las [color=#FFD16D]armas[/color].\n"
"La [color=#FFD16D]protección[/color] se obtiene sobre todo del resto del equipo.\n"
"\n"
"Puedes reducir el daño que te inflige un enemigo aumentando tu [color=#FFD16D]protección[/color]."

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Magic Elements"
msgstr "Elementos mágicos"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"[color=#FFD16D]Magic Weapons[/color] have [color=#FFD16D]Elements[/color] attached to them which determine what type of [color=aqua]Magic Spells[/color] you can use in Combat.\n"
"\n"
"Monsters may also have an [color=#FFD16D]Element[/color], which can either buff or debuff your character.\n"
"\n"
"Beating an Element grants you with [color=green]+15% Max Hit[/color].\n"
"Losing to an Element debuffs you with [color=orange_red]-15% Max Hit[/color].\n"
"\n"
"This is only applied to you, and never to the Enemy."
msgstr ""
"Las [color=#FFD16D]armas mágicas[/color] tienen [color=#FFD16D]elementos[/color] asociados que determinan qué tipo de [color=aqua]hechizos[/color] puedes usar en combate.\n"
"\n"
"Los monstruos también pueden tener un [color=#FFD16D]elemento[/color], que puede beneficiar o perjudicar a tu personaje.\n"
"\n"
"Vencer a un elemento te otorga [color=green]+15 % de golpe máx.[/color]\n"
"Perder contra un elemento te penaliza con [color=orange_red]-15 % de golpe máx.[/color]\n"
"\n"
"Esto solo se te aplica a ti, nunca al enemigo."

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Air:\n"
"[ul]Beats Earth\n"
"Loses to Fire[/ul]"
msgstr ""
"Aire:\n"
"[ul]Vence a Tierra\n"
"Pierde contra Fuego[/ul]"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Earth:\n"
"[ul]Beats Water\n"
"Loses to Air[/ul]"
msgstr ""
"Tierra:\n"
"[ul]Vence a Agua\n"
"Pierde contra Aire[/ul]"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Water:\n"
"[ul]Beats Fire\n"
"Loses to Earth[/ul]"
msgstr ""
"Agua:\n"
"[ul]Vence a Fuego\n"
"Pierde contra Tierra[/ul]"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Fire:\n"
"[ul]Beats Air\n"
"Loses to Water[/ul]"
msgstr ""
"Fuego:\n"
"[ul]Vence a Aire\n"
"Pierde contra Agua[/ul]"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Neutral has no effect."
msgstr "Neutro no tiene efecto."

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Using Prayers"
msgstr "Usar plegarias"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"[color=#FFD16D]Prayers[/color] are toggleable passive effects that can buff "
"your Character. These cost [color=#FFD16D]Prayer Points[/color] to remain "
"active."
msgstr ""
"Las [color=#FFD16D]plegarias[/color] son efectos pasivos que puedes activar "
"y desactivar para potenciar a tu personaje. Cuestan [color=#FFD16D]puntos de"
" plegaria[/color] mientras están activas."

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Obtaining Prayer Points"
msgstr "Obtener puntos de plegaria"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"[color=#FFD16D]Prayer Points[/color] are obtained by burying [u]Bones[/u] "
"dropped from slain Enemies (via your Bank), or through other methods such as"
" Firemaking."
msgstr ""
"Los [color=#FFD16D]puntos de plegaria[/color] se obtienen enterrando los "
"[u]huesos[/u] que sueltan los enemigos abatidos (desde tu inventario) o con "
"otros métodos, como Dominio del fuego."

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Prayer XP"
msgstr "XP de Plegaria"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"[color=#FFD16D]Prayer XP[/color] is gained while actively using "
"[color=#FFD16D]Prayers[/color]. Your damage dealt and cost of the Prayer "
"determines the XP gained, with higher cost Prayers providing more XP per "
"damage."
msgstr ""
"La [color=#FFD16D]XP de Plegaria[/color] se gana al usar activamente "
"[color=#FFD16D]plegarias[/color]. El daño que infliges y el coste de la "
"plegaria determinan la XP ganada; las plegarias más caras dan más XP por "
"daño."

#: Tutorials/cooking_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Cook Food"
msgstr "Cocina comida"

#: Tutorials/cooking_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Cook various types of Food to restore Health when consumed. Some Food also "
"provides special bonuses when used."
msgstr ""
"Cocina distintos tipos de comida que recuperan salud al consumirla. Algunas "
"comidas también dan bonificaciones especiales al usarlas."

#: Tutorials/cooking_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Cooking Success Chance"
msgstr "Probabilidad de éxito en Cocina"

#: Tutorials/cooking_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Your chance to successfully cook Food depends on your Cooking Proficiency compared to the Food's Difficulty.\n"
"\n"
"Cooking Proficiency can be increased by leveling Cooking, equipping Items, or via the Shop or other Skills."
msgstr ""
"Tu probabilidad de cocinar con éxito depende de tu competencia en Cocina frente a la dificultad de la comida.\n"
"\n"
"Puedes aumentar la competencia en Cocina subiendo de nivel Cocina, equipando objetos o mediante la tienda u otras habilidades."

#: Tutorials/cooking_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Create Bait"
msgstr "Crea cebo"

#: Tutorials/cooking_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Use Cooking to create Bait that helps with Fishing and Hunting."
msgstr "Usa Cocina para crear cebo que ayuda en Pesca y Caza."

#: Tutorials/cooking_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/crafting_tutorial.tscn
#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/firemaking_tutorial.tscn
#: Tutorials/fishing_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/fletching_tutorial.tscn
#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/mining_tutorial.tscn
#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/runecrafting_tutorial.tscn
#: Tutorials/smithing_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/thieving_tutorial.tscn
#: Tutorials/woodcutting_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/agility_tutorial.tscn
#: Tutorials/astrology_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/herblore_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Skill Synergies"
msgstr "Sinergias de habilidades"

#: Tutorials/crafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Craft Ranged Armour"
msgstr "Fabrica armaduras a distancia"

#: Tutorials/crafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Create Leather-based armour for use in Ranged Combat."
msgstr "Crea armaduras de cuero para el combate a distancia."

#: Tutorials/crafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Create Materials"
msgstr "Crea materiales"

#: Tutorials/crafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Craft materials and components used in other skills."
msgstr "Fabrica materiales y componentes que se usan en otras habilidades."

#: Tutorials/crafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Create Hunting Traps"
msgstr "Crea trampas de caza"

#: Tutorials/crafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Craft Traps used to catch creatures in Hunting."
msgstr "Fabrica trampas para capturar criaturas en Caza."

#: Tutorials/crafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Craft Jewellery"
msgstr "Fabrica joyería"

#: Tutorials/crafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Create Jewellery that provides various bonuses when equipped."
msgstr "Crea joyas que dan diversas bonificaciones al equiparlas."

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid "This is a Passive Skill which progresses while you play the game."
msgstr "Esta es una habilidad pasiva que avanza mientras juegas."

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Grow Crops"
msgstr "Cultiva cosechas"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Purchase Farming Plots and plant Seeds to grow various types of Crops."
msgstr ""
"Compra parcelas de cultivo y planta semillas para cultivar distintos tipos "
"de cosechas."

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Crop Care"
msgstr "Cuidado de cultivos"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Protect Crops from Pests and Disease, and keep them Watered to maximise "
"their rewards."
msgstr ""
"Protege los cultivos de plagas y enfermedades y mantenlos regados para "
"maximizar sus recompensas."

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Crop Types"
msgstr "Tipos de cultivo"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Grow Allotments for Cooking, Herbs for Herblore, Trees for Skill XP, and "
"Orchard Trees for Fruit."
msgstr ""
"Cultiva huertos para Cocina, hierbas para Herbología, árboles para XP de "
"habilidad y árboles frutales para obtener fruta."

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Composting"
msgstr "Compostaje"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Use Compost Bins to create Compost, which can be applied to Crops to "
"increase their output."
msgstr ""
"Usa compostadores para crear abono, que puedes aplicar a los cultivos para "
"aumentar su producción."

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Grain Mill"
msgstr "Molino de grano"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Use the Grain Mill to produce Grain for Ranching, and Flour and Sugar for "
"Cooking."
msgstr ""
"Usa el molino de grano para producir grano para Ganadería, y harina y azúcar"
" para Cocina."

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Farming Automation"
msgstr "Automatización de Agricultura"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Automate Planting, Harvesting, Watering and Composting to manage your Crops automatically.\n"
"\n"
"Automation consumes Wine to operate."
msgstr ""
"Automatiza la siembra, la cosecha, el riego y el compostaje para gestionar tus cultivos automáticamente.\n"
"\n"
"La automatización consume vino para funcionar."

#: Tutorials/firemaking_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Burn Logs"
msgstr "Quema troncos"

#: Tutorials/firemaking_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Burn Logs to gain Firemaking XP and a chance to receive random item rewards."
msgstr ""
"Quema troncos para ganar XP de Dominio del fuego y tener la probabilidad de "
"recibir objetos aleatorios como recompensa."

#: Tutorials/firemaking_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Light Lanterns"
msgstr "Enciende faroles"

#: Tutorials/firemaking_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Use Firemaking to light Lanterns, providing you with Light to take on Dark "
"Combat Areas."
msgstr ""
"Usa Dominio del fuego para encender faroles, que te dan luz para enfrentarte"
" a las zonas de combate oscuras."

#: Tutorials/firemaking_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Gain Prayer Points"
msgstr "Gana puntos de plegaria"

#: Tutorials/firemaking_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Burn special Prayer-related items obtained from Combat to gain Prayer Points"
" (used to train the Prayer Skill)."
msgstr ""
"Quema objetos especiales relacionados con Plegaria obtenidos en Combate para"
" ganar puntos de plegaria (que sirven para entrenar la habilidad Plegaria)."

#: Tutorials/fishing_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Select a location and a fishing spot to begin catching Fish."
msgstr "Elige una ubicación y un punto de pesca para empezar a pescar."

#: Tutorials/fishing_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Random Catches"
msgstr "Capturas aleatorias"

#: Tutorials/fishing_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Many fishing spots contain multiple types of Fish. Each catch randomly "
"determines which Fish you receive."
msgstr ""
"Muchos puntos de pesca tienen varios tipos de peces. Cada captura determina "
"al azar qué pez recibes."

#: Tutorials/fishing_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Junk"
msgstr "Basura"

#: Tutorials/fishing_tutorial.tscn
msgid "There is a chance to catch Junk instead of Fish."
msgstr "Existe la probabilidad de pescar basura en lugar de peces."

#: Tutorials/fishing_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Some fishing spots offer special items that you can collect while fishing."
msgstr ""
"Algunos puntos de pesca ofrecen objetos especiales que puedes conseguir "
"mientras pescas."

#: Tutorials/fletching_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Craft Ranged Equipment"
msgstr "Fabrica equipo a distancia"

#: Tutorials/fletching_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Create various types of Ranged weapons and ammunition for use in Combat.\n"
"\n"
"Some weapons require a certain type of ammunition, while others can be used individually."
msgstr ""
"Crea distintos tipos de armas a distancia y munición para usar en combate.\n"
"\n"
"Algunas armas requieren un tipo de munición concreto, mientras que otras se pueden usar por sí solas."

#: Tutorials/fletching_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/runecrafting_tutorial.tscn
#: Tutorials/smithing_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Crafting Steps"
msgstr "Pasos de fabricación"

#: Tutorials/fletching_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/runecrafting_tutorial.tscn
#: Tutorials/smithing_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Each item requires a set number of steps to complete. Ingredients are "
"consumed and rewards are granted upon completion."
msgstr ""
"Cada objeto requiere un número fijo de pasos para completarse. Los "
"ingredientes se consumen y las recompensas se otorgan al completarlo."

#: Tutorials/header_tutorial_button.tscn
msgid "Guide"
msgstr "Guía"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn Entities/Hunting/hunting_tracking_view.tscn
msgid "Hunt Animals"
msgstr "Caza animales"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Hunt various animals to collect rewards. Each animal requires a specific "
"type of Trap, created through Crafting."
msgstr ""
"Caza distintos animales para conseguir recompensas. Cada animal requiere un "
"tipo de trampa concreto, que se crea con Artesanía."

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "The Hunting Process"
msgstr "El proceso de caza"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Hunting is automatic and involves three stages: Surveying an area, Tracking an animal, and attempting to Trap it.\n"
"\n"
"If trapping fails, the animal flees and must be tracked again."
msgstr ""
"La caza es automática y tiene tres fases: hacer un reconocimiento de la zona, rastrear un animal e intentar atraparlo.\n"
"\n"
"Si el trampeo falla, el animal huye y hay que volver a rastrearlo."

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Animal Levels"
msgstr "Niveles de animal"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Each animal has its own Level and XP. Successfully hunting an animal "
"increases its XP, unlocking bonuses as it levels up."
msgstr ""
"Cada animal tiene su propio nivel y XP. Cazar un animal con éxito aumenta su"
" XP y desbloquea bonificaciones a medida que sube de nivel."

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Animal Size & Weight"
msgstr "Tamaño y peso de los animales"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Animals come in different Sizes and Weights. Larger and heavier animals "
"provide greater rewards when caught."
msgstr ""
"Los animales tienen distintos tamaños y pesos. Los animales más grandes y "
"pesados dan mejores recompensas al capturarlos."

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Rare Discoveries"
msgstr "Descubrimientos raros"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Discover rare animal species and collect special rewards while Hunting."
msgstr ""
"Descubre especies de animales raras y consigue recompensas especiales "
"mientras cazas."

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid "What is Hunting?"
msgstr "¿Qué es la Caza?"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid ""
"Hunting is a Skill that tasks you to hunt a variety of wild Animals & Beasts in order to acquire their rewards.\n"
"\n"
"Hunting feeds directly into [b]Beastcrafting[/b] as its primary use, while also rewarding you with various other Items such as [b]Herb Seeds[/b] and [b]Bones[/b]"
msgstr ""
"La Caza es una habilidad en la que tienes que cazar una gran variedad de animales y bestias salvajes para conseguir sus recompensas.\n"
"\n"
"Su uso principal es abastecer a [b]Artesanía bestial[/b], y además te recompensa con otros objetos, como [b]semillas de hierbas[/b] y [b]huesos[/b]"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid "What do I do?"
msgstr "¿Qué tengo que hacer?"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid ""
"Before you can hunt, you must craft a Trap in Crafting.\n"
"\n"
"Each Animal requires a specific Trap, which is listed in Hunting when you select the Animal.\n"
"\n"
"You can then hunt the Animal, which is an automatic 3-step process, rewarding you with Skill XP and Items upon successfully trapping the Animal."
msgstr ""
"Antes de poder cazar, debes fabricar una trampa en Artesanía.\n"
"\n"
"Cada animal requiere una trampa concreta, que aparece en Caza al seleccionar el animal.\n"
"\n"
"Después puedes cazar al animal mediante un proceso automático de 3 pasos que te recompensa con XP de habilidad y objetos al atraparlo con éxito."

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid "The automatic 3-step Hunting process"
msgstr "El proceso automático de caza en 3 pasos"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid ""
"Step 1 - Surveying\n"
"[ul]Search the location to find the Animal’s tracks.[/ul]\n"
"\n"
"Step 2 - Tracking\n"
"[ul]YFollow the tracks to locate the Animal.[/ul]\n"
"\n"
"Step 3 - Trapping\n"
"[ul]Use your crafted Trap and attempt to catch it.\n"
"Failing sends the Animal fleeing, returning you to Tracking.[/ul]"
msgstr ""
"Paso 1: Reconocimiento\n"
"[ul]Busca en la zona las huellas del animal.[/ul]\n"
"\n"
"Paso 2: Rastreo\n"
"[ul]Sigue las huellas para localizar al animal.[/ul]\n"
"\n"
"Paso 3: Trampeo\n"
"[ul]Usa la trampa que has fabricado e intenta atraparlo.\n"
"Si fallas, el animal huye y vuelves al rastreo.[/ul]"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid ""
"[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] "
"[b]Happiness[/b] is calculated as the average of these 3 substats:"
msgstr ""
"La [img "
"height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] "
"[b]Felicidad[/b] se calcula como la media de estas 3 subestadísticas:"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid ""
"[ul]Keep your Animals fed every hour.\n"
"Lose 10% every hour an Animal is not fed.\n"
"Replenish to 100% when fed.[/ul]"
msgstr ""
"[ul]Alimenta a tus animales cada hora.\n"
"Pierden un 10 % por cada hora sin comer.\n"
"Vuelve al 100 % al alimentarlos.[/ul]"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid ""
"[ul]Keep Enclosures repaired as they degrade by 1% every hour.\n"
"This does not affect Animal's Happiness until it falls below 75%.[/ul]"
msgstr ""
"[ul]Mantén los recintos reparados, ya que se deterioran un 1 % cada hora.\n"
"Esto no afecta a la felicidad de los animales hasta que baja del 75 %.[/ul]"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid ""
"[ul]Animals have unique needs that can be met to boost Satisfaction.\n"
"Managing this allows Happiness to increase above 100%.[/ul]"
msgstr ""
"[ul]Los animales tienen necesidades únicas que puedes cubrir para aumentar su satisfacción.\n"
"Gestionarlas permite que la felicidad supere el 100 %.[/ul]"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid ""
"[color=green]Begin the Skill by purchasing your first plot of "
"[b][color=white]Land[/color][/b] and building an "
"[b][color=white]Enclosure[/color][/b].[/color]"
msgstr ""
"[color=green]Empieza la habilidad comprando tu primera parcela de "
"[b][color=white]terreno[/color][/b] y construyendo un "
"[b][color=white]recinto[/color][/b].[/color]"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
#: Entities/Quests/act_progressed_popup.tscn
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "Continuar"

#: Tutorials/mining_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Select a rock to begin mining for Ore, Essence, Gems and other rewards."
msgstr ""
"Elige una roca para empezar a extraer mineral, esencia, gemas y otras "
"recompensas."

#: Tutorials/mining_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Breaking Rocks"
msgstr "Romper rocas"

#: Tutorials/mining_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Each hit has a chance to break the rock. If the Rock Break Bar reaches 100%,"
" the rock automatically breaks."
msgstr ""
"Cada golpe tiene una probabilidad de romper la roca. Si la barra de rotura "
"de roca llega al 100 %, la roca se rompe automáticamente."

#: Tutorials/mining_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Mining Rewards"
msgstr "Recompensas de Minería"

#: Tutorials/mining_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Breaking a rock grants its rewards."
msgstr "Romper una roca otorga sus recompensas."

#: Tutorials/mining_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/woodcutting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Rewards Per Hit"
msgstr "Recompensas por golpe"

#: Tutorials/mining_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Some rocks also provide rewards with every hit, even before they break."
msgstr ""
"Algunas rocas también dan recompensas con cada golpe, incluso antes de "
"romperse."

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Raise Animals"
msgstr "Cría animales"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Purchase Land, build Enclosures, and buy Animals using Gold Pieces. Each "
"Animal has a limited lifespan before it moves on."
msgstr ""
"Compra terreno, construye recintos y compra animales con monedas de oro. "
"Cada animal tiene una vida limitada antes de marcharse."

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Feed Your Animals"
msgstr "Alimenta a tus animales"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Most Animals require Food to stay healthy, while some can survive without "
"being fed."
msgstr ""
"La mayoría de los animales necesitan comida para mantenerse sanos, aunque "
"algunos pueden sobrevivir sin que los alimentes."

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Animal Happiness"
msgstr "Felicidad de los animales"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Maintain your Animals' Comfort and increase their Satisfaction to improve "
"the rewards they produce."
msgstr ""
"Mantén la comodidad de tus animales y aumenta su satisfacción para mejorar "
"las recompensas que producen."

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Enclosure Maintenance"
msgstr "Mantenimiento de recintos"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Repair Enclosures to keep them in good condition, and give your Animals Pets"
" to meet their needs."
msgstr ""
"Repara los recintos para mantenerlos en buen estado y acaricia a tus "
"animales para cubrir sus necesidades."

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Ranching Rewards"
msgstr "Recompensas de Ganadería"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Animals automatically produce XP and item rewards every hour. Proper care "
"increases their output."
msgstr ""
"Los animales producen automáticamente XP y objetos como recompensa cada "
"hora. Un buen cuidado aumenta su producción."

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid "What is Ranching?"
msgstr "¿Qué es la Ganadería?"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid ""
"Ranching is a [b]Passive[/b] Skill designed to provide important raw resources used around the game in a passive manner.\n"
"\n"
"It is not designed to be the primary source of these resources, but instead be a source that can produce as you work on other Skills."
msgstr ""
"La Ganadería es una habilidad [b]pasiva[/b] pensada para proporcionar de forma pasiva recursos básicos importantes que se usan en todo el juego.\n"
"\n"
"No está pensada para ser la fuente principal de estos recursos, sino una fuente que produce mientras trabajas en otras habilidades."

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid ""
"You are tasked to purchase plots of [b]Land[/b] to build [b]Enclosures[/b] and look after various types of [b]Animals[/b].\n"
"\n"
"Each [b]Animal[/b] has a [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] [b]Happiness[/b] stat that needs to be managed, where your primary goal is to keep this at or above 100%.\n"
"\n"
"[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Icons/SkillIcon.png[/img] [b]Skill XP[/b] and resources are generated every 1 hour, multiplied by [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] [b]Happiness[/b]."
msgstr ""
"Tu tarea es comprar parcelas de [b]terreno[/b] para construir [b]recintos[/b] y cuidar de distintos tipos de [b]animales[/b].\n"
"\n"
"Cada [b]animal[/b] tiene una estadística de [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] [b]felicidad[/b] que debes gestionar; tu objetivo principal es mantenerla en el 100 % o por encima.\n"
"\n"
"La [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Icons/SkillIcon.png[/img] [b]XP de habilidad[/b] y los recursos se generan cada hora, multiplicados por la [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] [b]felicidad[/b]."

#: Tutorials/runecrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Craft Runes"
msgstr "Crea runas"

#: Tutorials/runecrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Create Runes required to cast Magic spells in Combat."
msgstr "Crea las runas necesarias para lanzar hechizos en combate."

#: Tutorials/runecrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Create Magic Equipment"
msgstr "Crea equipo mágico"

#: Tutorials/runecrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Craft Magic weapons and armour to improve your effectiveness in Combat."
msgstr ""
"Fabrica armas y armaduras mágicas para mejorar tu eficacia en combate."

#: Tutorials/smithing_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Smelt Bars"
msgstr "Funde lingotes"

#: Tutorials/smithing_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Smelt Ores obtained from Mining into Bars used for crafting equipment and "
"other items."
msgstr ""
"Funde los minerales obtenidos en Minería para obtener lingotes con los que "
"fabricar equipo y otros objetos."

#: Tutorials/smithing_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Create Weapons & Armour"
msgstr "Crea armas y armaduras"

#: Tutorials/smithing_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Use Bars to forge Melee-focused weapons and armour."
msgstr "Usa lingotes para forjar armas y armaduras de cuerpo a cuerpo."

#: Tutorials/smithing_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Create components used in Fletching to craft Ranged equipment."
msgstr ""
"Crea componentes que se usan en Arquería para fabricar equipo a distancia."

#: Tutorials/thieving_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/agility_tutorial.tscn
msgid "This Skill is dangerous and can deal damage to you."
msgstr "Esta habilidad es peligrosa y puede hacerte daño."

#: Tutorials/thieving_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Start Thieving"
msgstr "Empieza a robar"

#: Tutorials/thieving_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Steal from NPCs, Stalls, Locked Chests and Heists to obtain various rewards."
msgstr ""
"Roba a PNJ, puestos, cofres cerrados y golpes para conseguir distintas "
"recompensas."

#: Tutorials/thieving_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Thieving Success Chance"
msgstr "Probabilidad de éxito en Robo"

#: Tutorials/thieving_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Your chance to successfully steal depends on your Stealth compared to the "
"target's Perception."
msgstr ""
"Tu probabilidad de robar con éxito depende de tu sigilo frente a la "
"percepción del objetivo."

#: Tutorials/thieving_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Failed Attempts & Taking Damage"
msgstr "Intentos fallidos y daño recibido"

#: Tutorials/thieving_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Failing to steal causes you to take damage and become stunned. Dying may result in losing an equipped item.\n"
"\n"
"Equip Food from Cooking to automatically heal when your Health is low."
msgstr ""
"Si fallas un robo, recibes daño y quedas aturdido. Morir puede hacer que pierdas un objeto equipado.\n"
"\n"
"Equipa comida de Cocina para curarte automáticamente cuando tengas poca salud."

#: Tutorials/thieving_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Fortune"
msgstr "Fortuna"

#: Tutorials/thieving_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Increasing your Fortune boosts the quantity of item rewards received from "
"Thieving."
msgstr ""
"Aumentar tu fortuna incrementa la cantidad de objetos que recibes como "
"recompensa en Robo."

#: Tutorials/thieving_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Use Lockpicks to open Locked Chests, or find their Keys to greatly reduce "
"the Lockpick requirement."
msgstr ""
"Usa ganzúas para abrir cofres cerrados, o encuentra sus llaves para reducir "
"mucho el requisito de ganzúas."

#: Tutorials/thieving_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Complete multi-step Heists to earn rewards at each successful step, with "
"rare rewards available upon completion."
msgstr ""
"Completa golpes de varios pasos para ganar recompensas en cada paso "
"superado, con recompensas raras al completarlos."

#: Tutorials/woodcutting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Cut Trees"
msgstr "Tala árboles"

#: Tutorials/woodcutting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Select a tree to begin cutting it for Logs and other rewards."
msgstr ""
"Elige un árbol para empezar a talarlo y obtener troncos y otras recompensas."

#: Tutorials/woodcutting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Tree Health"
msgstr "Salud del árbol"

#: Tutorials/woodcutting_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Each hit reduces the tree's Health. Reduce its Health to 0 to collect its  "
"primary rewards."
msgstr ""
"Cada golpe reduce la salud del árbol. Redúcela a 0 para conseguir sus  "
"recompensas principales."

#: Tutorials/woodcutting_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Some trees also provide rewards with every hit, even before their Health "
"reaches zero."
msgstr ""
"Algunos árboles también dan recompensas con cada golpe, incluso antes de que"
" su salud llegue a cero."

